OpenStreetMap data
------------------
REQreate downloads street networks, points of interest, bus stops and other
features from OpenStreetMap at run time. No OpenStreetMap data is distributed
with this repository.

Networks, travel-time matrices and instances generated from that data are
derived from OpenStreetMap and must be attributed:

    Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
    Open Database License (ODbL): https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

If you publish or share generated networks or instances, keep this
attribution and follow the ODbL terms for the derived data.

Archived research scripts
-------------------------
legacy/ contains research scripts that analysed third-party trip datasets
(NYC TLC taxi trips, Chicago TNP trips, Austin and San Francisco Bay Area
data, Uber Movement). None of those datasets are included. Anyone obtaining
them must follow each provider's terms of use.
